1
00:00:00,167 --> 00:00:01,767
[MUSIC: Two-note mystery motif]

2
00:00:01,292 --> 00:00:06,012
NARRATOR: Arsenal. New season. Same bottle.

3
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,850
ARTETA: This year, no excuses.

4
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,800
ARTETA: I'm lifting that trophy,

5
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:16,570
ARTETA: not applauding somebody else!

6
00:00:19,708 --> 00:00:20,648
ARTETA: Bottles?

7
00:00:20,728 --> 00:00:22,378
ARTETA: Three years finishing second,

8
00:00:22,378 --> 00:00:24,108
ARTETA: and you've made us a subscription?

9
00:00:24,875 --> 00:00:27,425
DRIVER: Automatic renewal, boss.

10
00:00:27,535 --> 00:00:29,155
DRIVER: Cancel any time.

11
00:00:29,215 --> 00:00:30,475
DRIVER: Preferably before April.

12
00:00:31,333 --> 00:00:32,533
ARTETA: Hello, board?

13
00:00:32,573 --> 00:00:34,033
ARTETA: Buy me Gyökeres.

14
00:00:34,173 --> 00:00:35,483
ARTETA: A proper striker.

15
00:00:35,573 --> 00:00:36,433
ARTETA: Someone who finishes!

16
00:00:37,958 --> 00:00:40,608
NARRATOR: So they bought a striker.

17
00:00:40,658 --> 00:00:43,078
NARRATOR: Someone to finish the chances.

18
00:00:45,083 --> 00:00:47,403
ARTETA: Meet our real striker.

19
00:00:50,458 --> 00:00:52,058
GYÖKERES: Then why am I here?

20
00:00:52,542 --> 00:00:53,942
ARTETA: Win us corners.

21
00:00:54,022 --> 00:00:55,062
ARTETA: That's where we score.

22
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:57,300
ARTETA: Don't shoot!

23
00:00:57,350 --> 00:00:58,210
ARTETA: Hit the defender.

24
00:00:58,210 --> 00:01:00,170
ARTETA: Off him, out for a corner!

25
00:01:04,125 --> 00:01:05,675
ARTETA: Perfect. A corner!

26
00:01:05,765 --> 00:01:07,005
ARTETA: Now we can actually score.

27
00:01:09,834 --> 00:01:12,334
NARRATOR: Their attacking philosophy?

28
00:01:13,034 --> 00:01:14,384
NARRATOR: Win a corner.

29
00:01:14,634 --> 00:01:16,874
NARRATOR: Somebody’s forehead will do the rest.

30
00:01:20,959 --> 00:01:22,659
ARTETA: One nil! That’s enough football.

31
00:01:22,659 --> 00:01:23,839
ARTETA: Everybody back!

32
00:01:31,334 --> 00:01:32,934
NARRATOR: Lovely.

33
00:01:33,684 --> 00:01:37,134
NARRATOR: A goalkeeper protecting nine defenders.

34
00:01:38,542 --> 00:01:40,242
[MUSIC: Choir of approval]

35
00:01:43,459 --> 00:01:44,979
GYÖKERES: What am I supposed to do?

36
00:01:45,959 --> 00:01:47,159
ARTETA: Win another corner!

37
00:01:49,167 --> 00:01:50,767
[MUSIC: Two-note mystery motif]

38
00:01:51,375 --> 00:01:53,215
ARTETA: Nobody is getting past us.

39
00:01:55,375 --> 00:01:56,275
ARTETA: Again?

40
00:01:56,425 --> 00:01:57,825
ARTETA: We’ve built a fortress…

41
00:01:58,075 --> 00:02:00,575
ARTETA: and City are still right behind us.

42
00:02:01,125 --> 00:02:03,845
NARRATOR: And Pep had started warming up.

43
00:02:04,667 --> 00:02:06,167
[MUSIC: The title chase]

44
00:02:05,375 --> 00:02:10,415
NARRATOR: They could defend a one–nil. They couldn’t
defend a lead on the table.

45
00:02:14,375 --> 00:02:16,535
ARTETA: He’s only walking. We’re fine.

46
00:02:22,250 --> 00:02:23,530
ARTETA: WHY IS HE WALKING?

47
00:02:25,875 --> 00:02:27,775
PEP: Long season, Mikel.

48
00:02:29,584 --> 00:02:31,824
ARTETA: Eyes forward! Nobody look back!

49
00:02:34,792 --> 00:02:36,472
COURIER: Still delivering in May?

50
00:02:36,959 --> 00:02:38,319
ARTETA: NOT NOW!

51
00:02:41,875 --> 00:02:43,075
ARTETA: Keep hold of the lead!

52
00:02:47,084 --> 00:02:49,484
REFEREE: Penalty. Against Arsenal.

53
00:02:50,959 --> 00:02:53,759
RECORDED VOICE: For a penalty against Arsenal, please
hold.

54
00:02:54,375 --> 00:02:55,875
[MUSIC: Telephone hold music]

55
00:02:58,959 --> 00:03:02,079
OPERATOR: Mikel! Straight through, as always.

56
00:03:03,667 --> 00:03:05,667
ARTETA: Can you make that go away?

57
00:03:07,459 --> 00:03:10,419
OPERATOR: Of course. Would you like a corner with
that?

58
00:03:11,875 --> 00:03:13,075
ARTETA: Make it two.

59
00:03:16,375 --> 00:03:18,681
REFEREE: Hello? I’m still here.

60
00:03:19,167 --> 00:03:21,487
RECORDED VOICE: Your call is very important to us.

61
00:03:26,459 --> 00:03:32,939
NARRATOR: One goal for the title. And of course, one
bloody corner.

62
00:03:34,292 --> 00:03:36,372
GYÖKERES: Do I finally get to shoot?

63
00:03:36,875 --> 00:03:38,715
ARTETA: No. Stand there.

64
00:03:39,875 --> 00:03:41,275
[MUSIC: Two-note mystery motif]

65
00:03:40,375 --> 00:03:42,775
NARRATOR: There’s still time.

66
00:03:47,250 --> 00:03:50,210
GYÖKERES: I’m supposed to be the stri—

67
00:03:55,667 --> 00:03:56,867
GYÖKERES: That counts?

68
00:03:57,375 --> 00:03:58,815
ARTETA: Exactly as rehearsed.

69
00:04:01,667 --> 00:04:03,347
COURIER: So… who signs for these?

70
00:04:03,875 --> 00:04:05,235
ARTETA: Wrong address.

71
00:04:07,584 --> 00:04:08,464
REFEREE: Finally!

72
00:04:08,959 --> 00:04:12,319
RECORDED VOICE: Thank you for waiting. The season has
now ended.

73
00:04:21,375 --> 00:04:22,875
[MUSIC: The familiar two notes]

74
00:04:23,084 --> 00:04:24,284
[MUSIC: The final note]

75
00:04:24,667 --> 00:04:26,875
FERGUSON: I SAID I WAS RETIRED!

76
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:30,000
FERGUSON: STOP GIVING ME REASONS TO COME BACK!
